data: {"id": "24eda873a4794a96-thinking-parallel_evidence-2324", "run_id": "24eda873a4794a96", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我整理已采集的事实，分析该 Pod 的 NotReady 状态。\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6`，命名空间 `aiops-case-09`\n- **UID**: `3fce1c76-f1ba-4e68-8f05-a50d78a131c9`\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **创建时间**: 2026-09-03T17:53:37Z\n- **阶段**: Running（Pod 本身仍在运行）\n- **所有者**: ReplicaSet/workload-5f4fb9ff45\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令 `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`\n- **重启次数**: 0（容器从未崩溃重启）\n\n### 2. NotReady 状态确认\n**kubectl_get_yaml** 明确显示：\n- `Ready: s", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788464410775, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

