data: {"id": "24eda873a4794a96-final", "run_id": "24eda873a4794a96", "seq": 2329, "ts_ms": 1788464434880, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` | NotReady | Pod aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6 处于 NotReady 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` Ready=False (ContainersNotReady)；`restart_count`: 0 (fact-1328ee3decf5, fact-1c5235786caa) | 确认异常状态及无重启迹象，排除启动循环或重启导致的不稳定 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning Unhealthy 30s` Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503 (fact-2dfbdf61ea75) | 直接指向就绪探针因 HTTP 503 错误而持续失败 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Pattern `http_request` (level: error, message: \"dependency unavailable\", http_status: 503, path: \"/work\") 发生 8 次 (fact-6fa585aefa61) | 应用侧日志记录了具体的业务层错误和请求路径 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow | HTTP GET `/work` 返回 `response_code`: 503，耗时 min: 19047us，与日志关联的 trace_ids 存在 (fact-5b0f71b7b356) | 流量观测证实了 503 状态码及该端点在高延迟下仍然不可用 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 0 (fact-7e83ee17c7f6) | 印证 K8s State，排除因 OOMKilled 或 CrashLoopBackOff 引起的重启 |\n\n**证据分析：**\n1. K8s Event (证据 2) 明确指出了 Probe 失败的直接原因是 HTTP 503。\n2. Logging (证据 3) 与 Tracing (证据 4) 相互印证，确认了导致 503 的具体路径为 `/work` 且业务层错误为 `dependency unavailable`。\n3. 所有证据（事件、日志、流量）在时间窗口上相互匹配，共同指向应用层依赖故障，而非基础设施层（如调度、网络插件）的问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用底层依赖不可用 (dependency unavailable) → /work 端点返回 HTTP 503 (Service Unavailable) → kubelet Readiness Probe 连续失败 (statuscode: 503) → Pod 状态变为 NotReady (ContainersNotReady)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是**应用层下游依赖不可用**。\n\n具体表现为：应用在处理 `GET /work` 请求时，由于检测到 `dependency unavailable` 而直接返回了 `HTTP 503 Service Unavailable` 状态码（见 Logging 事实 3 和 Tracing 事实 4）。这一持续的业务层错误触发了 Kubelet 发起的 Readiness 探针连续失败（见 K8s Event 事实 2），导致 Kubernetes 将该 Pod 标记为 `NotReady`（见 K8s State 事实 1）。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实：**\n日志中的错误信息 `dependency unavailable` 较为笼统，无法识别出具体是哪个下游组件（如数据库、Redis 缓存或第三方 API）出现了故障。因此，虽然可以确定根因属于应用依赖层，但具体依赖目标未知。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 33.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 95.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6: 95.5s (Evidence 83.4s, RCA 11.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 141.003, "metrics": {"run_id": "24eda873a4794a96", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 141.00678277015686, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 141006.78277015686, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 109428.98511886597, "tool_calls": 20, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 110752.48265266418, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 30962.22996711731}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 33678.051710128784, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 95484.37190055847, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11821.587800979614, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

